me":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"IQ-FUxpwpibrfOpj6d8Asg","review_id":"sqBn0NGghzJMKZ6gqLcAdg","date":"2018-03-12T13:18:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9508898258209229,"text_excerpt":"I'm new to beignets, but the hype is true about Cafe Du Monde. I visited on a weekday when it wasn't quite so busy and scored a seat on the patio. The beignets were warm, soft and smothered in powdered sugar and the coffee was great too. I didn't realize they had no other food on the menu, but we were full after the beignets anyway. Definitely a must-go in New Orleans!"},{"business_id":"IQ-FUxpwpibrfOpj6d8Asg","review_id":"oi9pTMknh4yermJQIS2LIQ","date":"2017-12-31T15:07:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9458773136138916,"text_excerpt":"Cafe Du Monde is an obvious must if visiting New Orleans. We were glad we visited for delicious beignets. We each ordered one order of Beignets, three to an order. It was the perfect sized treat for us. The beignets were yummy, not too greasy and covered in plenty of powdered sugar. I wouldn't say they were mind blowing, but beignets are an obvious must when in New Orleans. This location was clean and quick at pumping out orders. The staff was on top of clearing tables so that tables were always ready. There are tables inside an some more outside along the water. We hoped to beat crowds by visiting this location inside of Outlet Collection at Riverwalk and it proved to be a good plan. At ..."},{"business_id":"IQ-FUxpwpibrfOpj6d8Asg","review_id":"x7uiS8CLNgwuYa8lmF307g","date":"2016-09-06T23:55:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9423877000808716,"text_excerpt":"So, I had to try the beignets here because everyone has raved about this place! The line wasnt long, so we were able to get our order within 5 minutes. There is also a small window where you can watch the cooks kneading the dough, etc. That was cool. The ladies working the line also let us taste the Cafe Au Lait prior to purchasing it to make sure we liked it, it was amazing by the way. The seating at this location is pretty limited since, which is surprising for how busy and popular they are. That being said, the seating area is a little dirty and hard to maneuver around, i would take this to go and eat it somewhere else in the mall or maybe outside on the riverwalk. The beignets were pr..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"IQ-FUxpwpibrfOpj6d8Asg","photo_id":"pFBRa3EkKAjNRpMoISbPHg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/pFBRa3EkKAjNRpMoISbPHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8861815929412842},{"business_id":"IQ-FUxpwpibrfOpj6d8Asg","photo_id":"wjdZQ_hOWMMunQ13cdih7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wjdZQ_hOWMMunQ13cdih7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8514807224273682},{"business_id":"IQ-FUxpwpibrfOpj6d8Asg","photo_id":"xFQaXc4gCGoa__JABlNDng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xFQaXc4gCGoa__JABlNDng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8463369607925415},{"business_id":"IQ-FUxpwpibrfOpj6d8Asg","photo_id":"I8YGKOU6k5jrQT7WXHJFfA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/I8YGKOU6k5jrQT7WXHJFfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7870256304740906},{"business_id":"IQ-FUxpwpibrfOpj6d8Asg","photo_id":"qf7APeo0qc7ScbrslK3TtQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qf7APeo0qc7ScbrslK3TtQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7733425498008728}]},"notebook_case":null}
